# Static Linux — Themed XFCE environment
# Tier: Minimum functional (1 GB). Xorg. Forced fallback when Wayland is out.
# Validated on Packard Bell iMedia S2883 (J1900, Bay Trail).

# xfce4 and xfce4-goodies are pacman GROUPS, not individual packages — that's
# why they return 0 hits on archlinux.org/packages/search/json (that API only
# indexes packages, not groups). Confirmed real via
# archlinux.org/groups/x86_64/xfce4/ and .../xfce4-goodies/ 2026-09-21.
# pacstrap/mkarchiso resolve groups fine (base-devel above is the same case).
xfce4
xfce4-goodies
xfce4-pulseaudio-plugin
xfce4-whiskermenu-plugin
# estante style: centred dock on the shelf + Roboto as its UI font (OFL)
xfce4-docklike-plugin
ttf-roboto
xfce4-screenshooter
xfce4-notifyd
xfce4-power-manager

# Session / login
lightdm
lightdm-gtk-greeter
lightdm-gtk-greeter-settings

# File manager + mounting
thunar
thunar-volman
thunar-archive-plugin
gvfs
gvfs-mtp
file-roller
tumbler

# Apps / utilities
mousepad
ristretto
xarchiver
network-manager-applet
blueman
galculator
xdg-user-dirs-gtk
# output names for the wallpaper autostart (branding/accents/sync-wallpaper.sh)
xorg-xrandr
# Super tap -> Whisker menu (see skel autostart/dev.staticforge.super-key.desktop)
xcape

# Media codecs for Parole (ships in xfce4-goodies, plays through GStreamer).
# Without gst-libav an .mp4 fails with "MPEG-4 AAC decoder" missing — seen
# on the PC Principal.
gst-libav
gst-plugins-bad
gst-plugins-ugly

# Theming (Static Linux look)
gnome-themes-extra
papirus-icon-theme
kvantum
qt5ct
qt6ct
xdg-desktop-portal-gtk
xdg-desktop-portal-xapp

# Terminal
xfce4-terminal

# sl-screenshot on X11 (Super+Shift+S)
maim
xclip
